## 3. Industry-Specific Risk
**Part A — Why This Company Can Compound:**  
Investments in AI → improves search relevance → increases ad revenue → attracts more users → strengthens network effects → drives cloud adoption. This virtuous cycle is self-reinforcing and scalable. **Durability Verdict:** High, with structural advantages unlikely to erode.

**Part B — Business Model Risk:**  
1. Regulatory scrutiny (HIGH) — antitrust risks in search and advertising dominate Alphabet’s business model.  
2. AI competition (MEDIUM) — Google faces rising threats from OpenAI and Microsoft in generative AI.  
3. Economic sensitivity (LOW) — digital ad spending is cyclical but Alphabet has shown resilience.  

